{
  "id": "45",
  "title": "喜忌篇",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“喜忌篇”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱排定，三才次分，专以日上天元，配合八字支干；有见不见之形，无时不有；神煞相绊，轻重较量。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-3aa9b19f7ab096f1f343-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若乃，时逢七杀，见之未必为凶；月制干强，其杀反为权印。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-82e3d63664100902ecab-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财官印綬全备，藏蓄于月季之中。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-59f16ba1d53c1c23c95b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官星财气长生，镇居于寅申巳亥。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-97c5a9f4b250e4cddcca-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚申时逢戊日，名食神干旺之方；岁月犯甲丙卯寅，此乃遇而不遇。（合禄格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-3aa122951118503e3d39-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "月生日干无天财，乃印綬之名。（印綬格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-e76120a62e6e6ec01b16-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日禄居时没官星，号『青云得路』。（归禄格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-7e93fe3bbe83ee3865b9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳水叠逢辰位，是『壬骑龙背』之乡。（壬骑龙背格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-11e6fc47956eeaed5dbe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阴木独遇子时，为『六乙鼠贵』之地。（六乙鼠贵格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-4a21b5c05693685a0883-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚日全逢润下，忌壬癸巳午之方；时遇子申，其福减半。（井栏叉格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-a9e3cb2d95dbaf6aed1f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若逢伤官月建，如凶处未必为凶；内有正倒禄飞，忌官星，亦嫌羈绊。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-e7053baf5a07b5f0f8c7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "六癸日时逢寅位，岁月怕戊己二方。（刑合格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-f3592ec643df2c87089c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲子日再逢子时，畏庚辛申酉丑午。（子遥巳格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-d61ff3a063e3573e1b16-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛癸日多逢丑地，不喜官星；岁时逢子巳二宫，虚名虚利。（丑遥巳格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-15795037174c1cf1204e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "拱禄拱贵，填实则凶。（拱禄格、拱贵格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-c4333c6c676633538e67-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时上偏财，别宫忌见。（时上偏财格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-7b6bd5094b4d91f38e4a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "六辛日逢戊子，嫌午未位，运喜西方。（六阴朝阳格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-291ae5fa76d182e2fe6d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五行遇月支偏官，岁月时中亦宜制伏；类有去官留杀，亦有去杀留官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-43434f28b0f340e2a206-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱纯杂有制，定居一品之尊；略有一位正官，官杀混杂反贱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-98d5d7da207a2fdbdc8e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "戊日午月，勿作刃看；时岁火多，却为印綬。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-31e6a321798c33f42737-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "月令虽逢建禄，切忌会杀为凶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-30e0924019929b184a90-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官星七杀交差，却以合杀为贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-7852d89fa2b45195471a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "柱中官星太旺，天元羸弱之名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-12a2fcaf80a71ba2282d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日干旺甚无依，若不为僧即道。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-39cdf6393510eeda14ac-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬生月，岁时忌见财星；运入财乡，却宜退身避位。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-9d16e946470567ac5247-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "劫财阳刃，切忌时逢；岁运併临，灾殃立至。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-5f83c25b3bec0f3468ac-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "十干背禄，岁时喜见财星；运至比肩，号曰『背禄逐马』。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-3b92d5d17c6642b6909a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五行正贵，忌冲刑剋破之宫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-392c244ff528c315ddaa-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱干支，喜三合六合之地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-4b155fd4fba643c78bf9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日干无气，时逢阳刃不为凶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-ba74396a7eb468fa2be8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官杀两停，喜者存之，憎者弃之。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-f3c4d9353a8ab2fa18ea-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "地支天干合多，亦云『贪合忘官』。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-c7b7f387d756720faddd-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱杀旺运纯，身旺为官清贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-30f797cf940955819ccd-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "凡见天元太弱，内有弱处复生。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-ef78c6f301b95b234d9a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "柱中七杀全彰，身旺极贫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-70b0a72613e026176fd3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "无杀女人之命，一贵可作良人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-5027dfa7badfad30d5ca-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "贵众合多，定是师妮娼婢。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-d56e9224787208e83064-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "偏官时遇，制伏太过，乃是贫儒。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-f4b4a2198b0120086742-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱伤官，运入官乡必破。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-a5a3561656d1b9073965-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五行绝处，即是『胎元』；生日逢之，名曰『受气』。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-d3a61d98120639f9d53a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "是以阴阳罕测，不可一例而推，务要稟得中和之气。神分贵贱，略敷古圣之遗书，纵约以今贤之博览。若通此法参详，鑑命无差无误矣！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-ceb4ae2f5c1a529fb36c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "继善篇》",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-550c62a6957fbaaa9e61-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "人稟天地，命属阴阳，生居覆载之内，尽在五行之中。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-d37c9529020c671289d0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "欲知贵贱，先观月令乃提纲，次断吉凶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-352b053813f8832451c2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "专用日干为主本；三元要成格局，四柱喜见财官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-aa1e7a003fd613b52f06-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "用神不可损伤。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-1027473bf81b193a6203-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日主最宜健旺。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-9d541bade30be67c017d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "年伤日干，名为『主本不和』。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-8a768919ce8d1ef9f05c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "岁月时中，大怕杀官混杂。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-da15272b73824d78481a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "取用凭于生月，当推究于浅深；发觉在于日时，要消详于强弱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-1d14e66bd6e4268c8f2b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官星正气，忌见刑冲。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-80106686305a5f45224c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时上偏财，怕逢兄弟。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-1a60c439215db23c6f3a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "生气印綬，利官运，畏见财乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-d3ce1887d662ffea2e8f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "七杀偏官，喜制伏，不宜太过。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-eb3775cfac64c3c7c1fd-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官复行官运，不测灾来。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-c76a55d57842522ba51a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃冲合岁君，勃然祸至。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-7cb8a649c16e1fbf2ecc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "富而且贵，定因财旺生官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-78019503542ffe36007c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "非夭则贫，必是身衰遇鬼。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-e72441f7cbbe3410f9cc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "六壬生临午位，号曰『禄马同乡』。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-673e253a27b1b362a4de-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸日生向巳宫，乃是『财官双美』。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-93d00bdc9dfb7def028b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财多身弱，正为富屋贫人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-ffe818cadaa81dc7f15d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "以杀化权，定显寒门贵客。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-6aec9f55784280086fb4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "登科甲第，官星临无破之宫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-4650cfb9514df1f7e82a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "纳粟奏名，财库居生旺之地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-575c9e677880c450a14a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官贵太甚，纔临旺处必倾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-1bd3c3cc8346ac5d8c80-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬被伤，倘若荣华不久。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-4acf416e1d8589fc01e6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "有官有印，无破作廊庙之材。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-ab080c9f6a7fa810713d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "无官无印，有格乃朝廷之用。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-e9f9f7f46efaf2c42828-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "名标金榜，须还身旺逢官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-097085568a081adc9b97-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "得佐圣君，贵在冲官逢合。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-96c5029dfcd6f4b13533-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "非格非局，见之焉得为奇。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-ddef6940f2eadd169a46-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身弱遇官，得后徒然费力。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-379061a2ce359f5616e0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "小人命内，亦有正印官星。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-8b5cafdb521681bea5ca-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "君子格中，也犯七杀阳刃。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-f0b8d2c7cb31e44d5fb9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "为人好杀，阳刃必犯于偏官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-e18f6cde621dcfe09d78-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "素食慈心，印綬遂逢于天德。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-8973910946edc93e5535-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "生平少病，日主高强。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-b9e104158d43fba2f65e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "一世安然，财命有气。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-f6e3093c8fe821014c26-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官刑不犯，印綬天德同宫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-79b8f64767ff177e509c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "少乐多忧，盖因日主自弱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-751abb7f628f3f4097fe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身强杀浅，假杀为权。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-27b814be2a99a1061da1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀重身轻，终身有损。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-03318d306de920715d8c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "衰则变官为鬼，旺则化鬼为官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-f3eb13c22b3f88c8aa70-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "月生日干，运行不喜财乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-a8a16017959a08803267-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日主无依，却喜运行财地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-5f1dd95cbee46d48af5b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时归日禄，生平不喜官星。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-cf0573c50969b8358c0b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阴若朝阳（辛日戊子时），切忌丙丁离位。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-8aa0b7c27fa86f5abc78-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "太岁乃众杀之主，入命未必为灾；若遇斗战之乡，必主刑于本命。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-65ad225e34d5bfe1bddc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "岁伤日干，有祸必轻。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-a33f50c4a8c9e93515ec-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日犯岁君，灾殃必重；五行有救，其年反必为财。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-2f5501fbb9f54ed8f525-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱无情，故论名为『剋岁』。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-347006b0b5f241d522b6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚辛来伤甲乙，丙丁先见无危；丙丁反剋庚辛，壬癸遇之不畏；戊己愁逢甲乙，干头须要庚辛；壬癸透露戊己，甲乙临之有救；壬来剋丙，须要戊字当头；癸去伤丁，却喜己来相制。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-6c45ea08450b55934b75-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚得壬男制丙，夭作长年。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-09800508c1fcfc5bf0ed-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲以乙妹妻庚，凶为吉兆。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-6d4fc4a36c972a4dff43-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "天元虽旺，若无依倚是常人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-5d12e2bce472880fe266-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日主太柔，纵遇财官为寒士。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-c1492e5ee3a0c3d82e98-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "女人无杀、带二德，作两代之封。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-b3e7570095793c5955b4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "男命身强、遇三奇，为一品之贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-8b6ce55bb2d4440109b0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲逢己而生旺，定怀中正之心。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-fabd8be700286ebe23c3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丁遇壬而太过，必犯淫讹之乱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-c780ce64930f13a79873-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丙临申位，逢阳水难获延年。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-01a0c48941d2b4945321-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "己入亥宫，见阴木终为损寿。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-e360566c65debade216b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚值寅而遇丙，生旺无危。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-a0aa788f7ee4ec97ac9c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙遇巳而见辛，身衰有祸。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-613efc9af424477fb419-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙逢庚旺，常存仁义之风。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-440a6c2ccb0dce323ff2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丙合辛生，镇掌威权之职。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-08fef893e2a38900e88e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "一木重逢火位，名为气散之文。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-7bd2d9ce5faeb9f25889-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "独水三犯庚辛，号曰体全之象。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-f714da3a5f0b6414f8a7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "水归冬旺，生平乐自无忧。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-38a5f5ada4c3d6cacdf0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "木向春生，处世安然必寿。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-0acc4a599684c6e593cd-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金弱遇火炎之地，血疾无疑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-8bc956657a1149d1a070-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "土虚逢木旺之乡，脾伤定论。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-67b0ec8e23fc8189b7e4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "筋疼骨痛，盖因木被金伤。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-4da4a654aef6a1f55715-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "眼昏目暗，必是火遭水剋。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-0ba6275ee44c58dbba55-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "下元冷疾，必是水值火伤。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-3bf5e86647b756c79528-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金逢艮（寅）而遇土，号曰还魂。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-9a5abd2b426a645ee954-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "水入巽（巳）而见金，名为不绝。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-ad4213558c8ffc7c71c7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "土临卯位，未中年便作灰心。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-35070828ff59c6afe291-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金遇火乡，虽少壮必然挫志。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-1c2c5ad4684d8fe8d6a9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金木交差刑战，仁义俱无。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-a7f5b6a2dcc0d5e22c03-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "水火递互相伤，是非日有。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-6ef1962a535d0c2c95cf-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "木从水养，水盛而木则漂流。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-ec5197cd1ada05aa9bf5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金赖土生，土厚而金遭埋没。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-5c17764354f438b5b5ae-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "是以五行不可偏枯，务稟中和之气；更须绝虑忘思，鑑命无差误矣！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "45-240aa4f9059b319a0191-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
